# The data files are binary and must never be touched. Git usually works this
# out on its own, but "usually" is not a good enough guarantee for a file whose
# every byte is an offset: a single line-ending conversion would shift the
# arrays and draw a coastline through the Gulf of Guinea.
*.bin   binary
*.png   binary

# Everything else is text and can be normalised.
*.html  text
*.js    text
*.css   text
*.json  text
*.md    text
